[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10561.83, "timestamp": "02:56:01", "text": "花了一段时间，所以我有点……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10565.269, "timestamp": "02:56:05", "text": "时间太晚了，所以我快速地把日程安排搞定了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10567.59, "timestamp": "02:56:07", "text": "所以在Discord服务器上"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10569.83, "timestamp": "02:56:09", "text": "大多数人不会参加节目安排频道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10571.349, "timestamp": "02:56:11", "text": "能够查看日程频道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10574.15, "timestamp": "02:56:14", "text": "因为现在它是一个资源渠道。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10576.23, "timestamp": "02:56:16", "text": "点击服务器指南，你就可以获取……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10578.79, "timestamp": "02:56:18", "text": "您可以查看日程安排，而且"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10584.87, "timestamp": "02:56:24", "text": "自动化的也包括在内。你好。嗯，是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10587.349, "timestamp": "02:56:27", "text": "正如你今天看到的直播画面，呃，或者类似的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10589.59, "timestamp": "02:56:29", "text": "本周所有直播内容都在这里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10592.79, "timestamp": "02:56:32", "text": "这里。所以，请务必遵守。和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10596.23, "timestamp": "02:56:36", "text": "另外，呃，我不会进行直播。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10599.269, "timestamp": "02:56:39", "text": "星期四和星期五。那是8月10日。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10604.07, "timestamp": "02:56:44", "text": "以及8月11日。你好。所以，是的，我不会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10605.83, "timestamp": "02:56:45", "text": "虽然在直播，但我知道这是我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10608.95, "timestamp": "02:56:48", "text": "生日周，我的生日是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10611.59, "timestamp": "02:56:51", "text": "8月7日等等。所以，别担心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10614.15, "timestamp": "02:56:54", "text": "别担心。我们将进行倒计时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10614.99, "timestamp": "02:56:54", "text": "和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10617.51, "timestamp": "02:56:57", "text": "一切。等待。嗯，是的，我不会"}]